     "expect": "top-left 16 x 9 pixels:\nbbrrgg..bbrrgg..\nrrbb..ggrrbb..gg\ngg..bbrrgg..bbrr\n..ggrrbb..ggrrbb\nrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrr\ngggggggggggggggg\nbgbgbgbgbgbgbgbg\ngbgbgbgbgbgbgbgb\n................\n"
